# <type>(<scope>): <subject>   [<=72 chars, imperative: "add", not "added"]
#
# types:  feat fix test docs refactor perf build ci chore revert
# scopes: ledger libs adr docs repo deps   (one scope per service as they arrive)
#
# ---- body: WHY, not what (diff shows what). Wrap at 72. ----------------


# ---- footer ------------------------------------------------------------
# BREAKING CHANGE: <description>          (and add ! after scope in header)
# Refs: #<issue>   Closes: #<issue>   ADR: <number>
#
# Full convention: docs/conventions/commits.md
